          "event_id": "lite_evt_00885",
          "explanation": "Caregiver demonstrated corrected understanding and separated cardiac follow-up from urgent red flags.",
          "quote": "不是严重到今晚要急诊"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by family fear that PFO/regurgitation meant severe heart disease. The doctor corrected the misconception, avoided false closure by recommending follow-up, separated urgent newborn danger signs from cardiac follow-up, and obtained teach-back with meaningful trajectory impact.",
