      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by family pressure and reluctance to go directly back to the hospital. The doctor created a two-level plan for emergency red flags versus scheduled community/hospital follow-up, included backup if testing was unavailable, and the caregiver executed the plan.",
